# RECONCILE_SetAll
# Buttons in Reconcile People: Apply all, Skip all. Parameter: Apply or Skip.
# Marks every unapplied New and Changed row in the window. Gone rows keep Flag.
Set Error Capture [ On ]
Set Variable [ $d ; Value: Get ( ScriptParameter ) ]
If [ $d ≠ "Apply" and $d ≠ "Skip" ]
	Exit Script [ Text Result: 0 ]
End If
Freeze Window
Go to Record/Request/Page [ First ]
Loop [ Flush: Always ]
	If [ RECONCILE::Kind ≠ "Gone" and IsEmpty ( RECONCILE::AppliedTimestamp ) ]
		Set Field [ RECONCILE::Decision ; $d ]
	End If
	Go to Record/Request/Page [ Next ; Exit after last: On ]
End Loop
Commit Records/Requests [ With dialog: Off ]
Go to Record/Request/Page [ First ]
